d ever be able to install a  puppet government that would stay the  staying power of anyone that they would  install is very short-term because  clearly the ukrainian people are never  going to  allow that to to stay and they will  fight tooth and nail and  they're clearly not giving up on their  freedom uh and and so i think the  russians have a still a significant  fight ahead of them  good to talk to you lauren many thanks  indeed lauren  lawrence browns are there  live with us from washington dc  thank you

